=== Choose a Continuity Sponsor === #^event:choose-alliance

-> "The Official Restoration Plan" { $"route"<variable:route> == "ministry" } #^transition:alliance-to-ministry
-> "The Cooperative Fork" { $"route"<variable:route> == "freeplot" } #^transition:alliance-to-freeplot
-> "Lunch with Continuity Studios" { $"route"<variable:route> == "studio" } #^transition:alliance-to-studio

? Select an approach #^decision:select-alliance
* [Restore the official canon] #^outcome:route-ministry
    ~ $"route"<variable:route> = "ministry"
    ~ $"compliance"<variable:compliance> = 2
* [Open the stories] #^outcome:route-freeplot
    ~ $"route"<variable:route> = "freeplot"
    ~ $"solidarity"<variable:solidarity> = 2
* [Make the reboot spectacular] #^outcome:route-studio
    ~ $"route"<variable:route> = "studio"
    ~ $"spectacle"<variable:spectacle> = 2
    ~ $"ambition"<variable:ambition> = true
